      "word": "INMATE",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "One who lives in the same house or apartment with another; a fellow lodger; esp.,one of the occupants of an asylum, hospital, or prison; by extension, one who occupies or lodges in any place or dwelling. So spake the enemy of mankind, inclos'd In serpent, inmate bad. Milton.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
